note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note OM-1 bounded SHA256 adaptation of omega-mv 6999fa9e om/sha256.
note Constants copied from filed sha256-k.dec and sha256-iv.dec; no generated constants.
note Exact used bytes only; no identity schema and no implicit padding.
fn kc_rotr x uint n uint to uint
ret or shr x n shl x sub uint 32 n
end
fn kc_k k edit uint 64 to void
put k 0 1116352408
put k 1 1899447441
put k 2 3049323471
